invariant: INV-16
file: src/p256_wide_field.h
catches: diff_p256_wide
reason: p256_wide_fe_half shifts the four words of a + p and drops the
  carry out of them, bit 256 of the sum. An odd element whose sum with p
  passes 2^256 then halves to a value 2^255 too small. The differential
  halves p - 2, whose sum with p carries, against the Lean product of it
  and the inverse of 2.

--- old
    o->word[3] = (s3 >> 1) | (carry << 63);
--- new
    o->word[3] = s3 >> 1;
